  "solution": "The logic followed here is,\n\n**Logic: a @ b = (a × b) + (a − b)**\n\n**For,**\n\n3 @ 2 ⇒ (3 × 2) + (3 − 2) = 6 + 1 = **7**\n\n6 @ 3 ⇒ (6 × 3) + (6 − 3) = 18 + 3 = **21**\n\n8 @ 2 ⇒ (8 × 2) + (8 − 2) = 16 + 6 = **22**\n\nSimilarly,\n\n5 @ 4 ⇒ (5 × 4) + (5 − 4) = 20 + 1 = **21**\n\nSo, the value of 5 @ 4 is **21**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"option 1 \"**",
